+     - Normal line: `    {label} {badge} \x1b[90m{hint}\x1b[0m`
+     - Footer: `\x1b[90m  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\x1b[0m\n  \x1b[90m↑/↓ Navigate • ↵ Select • Esc Back\x1b[0m`
+     - Redraw loop: Move cursor up by line count (`\x1b[{}A`), clear line (`\x1b[2K\r`), and redraw.
